  "details": "I get this strange error only on my A12Z iPad Pro 12.9 when I join my home world (TheFoxCliffHouse\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/launch?worldId=wrld_06133ecb-2506-4575-b993-37d122751be3 )\n\nMy iPad will flicker and freeze the game completely, forcing me to close the app.\n\nThis error does not happen on my iPhone 15 Pro Max, and only seems to happen on my ipad, here's a video of the bug happening:\n\nhttps://mega.nz/file/6Nt1WQRJ#wQBmXy-wAWgBIm1ptLj0wUxcW_8u_DareupxWKlLNb0",
